          "original_text": "The table below shows affiliates that are indirectly controlled by the Company \nthrough Galderma Holding SA. The Company obtained control of these affiliates when \nit became the parent of Galderma Holding SA on March 21, 2024.",
          "acquired_at": "2026-10-07T12:53:16.527545Z",
