          "page": 1,
          "original_text": "We are issuing Department of Health and Human Services U.S. License No. 2289 to \nGalderma Laboratories, L.P., Dallas, Texas, under the provisions of section 351 (a) of \nthe Public Health Service Act controlling the manufacture and sale of biological \nproducts.",
