          "url": "https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2025/761390s002%2C761391s001lbl.pdf",
          "page": 8,
          "original_text": "Nemolizumab-ilto, an interleukin-31 receptor alpha (IL-31RA) antagonist, is a humanized monoclonal modified \nimmunoglobulin G (IgG) antibody with a molecular weight of approximately 144 kDa.",
          "acquired_at": "2026-10-07T12:53:16.683954Z",
          "observed_publicly_available_at": "2026-10-07T12:28:06.672448Z"
        },
        {
          "fragment_id": "evidence-fragment_e47607f0a98710c6dc4c21cd",
